  "description": "EFBox enhances Entity Framework (Core) with high-performance bulk operations for inserting, updating, upserting, deleting and merging data.\n\n            # Accelerate Data Operations with EFBox\n            # Simplify Bulk Inserts, Updates, Upserts, Deletes and Merges in Entity Framework (Core)\n            # Ideal for Large Datasets, Migrations, and Data Synchronization\n            \n            EFBox integrates with your DbContext, enabling fast and efficient data processing without complex workarounds. \n            It supports batching, transactions, and custom mappings to give you full control over your data workflows.\n            \n            For tutorials, examples, and documentation visit:\n            https://www.efbox.net",
